  "details": "Description\n\nI would like to report a bug with the Chatbox.\n\nSummary:\n\nWhen the Chatbox is open and the text input field is focused, pressing the \"Y\" key does not type the letter \"y\". Instead, it closes/cancels the Chatbox. As a result, I cannot type any message containing the letter \"y\".\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nExpected Behavior:\n\nWhile the Chatbox input field is focused, pressing Y should enter the character \"y\". The Y key should only open/close the Chatbox when the input field is not focused.\n\nActual Behavior:\n\nPressing Y while typing in the Chatbox input field closes/cancels the Chatbox instead of entering \"y\".\n\nReproducibility:\n\nEvery time / 100%.\n\nImpact:\n\nUsers cannot type normal messages containing the letter \"y\" in the Chatbox. This is a significant usability issue for English and other languages that use the letter Y.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 用户界面\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1913-a070c3378e-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-16_22-46-13.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_27dce7d2-0b05-47bd-add6-7b4cb987fbcb/1/file)",
